    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75105" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρισ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for defining,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					413a14
				</span></i>
			,al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1026d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδασκαλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.307
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κή, ἡ,</span>
			<i>art of definition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in APr.</u>
				7.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Elias
				<u>in Porph.</u>
				3.28
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>by definition,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				12.12
			</span></i> : 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κώτερον, ἐπιδραμεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.463
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>giving definite form to,</i> c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				275.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὁριστική</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγκλισις</span>), <i>indicative</i> mood,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				638.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				31.14
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὰ ῥήματα</span>
			<i>indicative</i> verbs, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				124.9
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὴ προφορά</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				123.12
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>in the indicative mood,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.
					337
				</span></i>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				87
			</span></i>.</div>
